---
title: role.bodyguard.allow-continuous-protection=true (default) で連続ガードが効果を持つ
setup: { bodyguard: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 3 }
rules:
  role.bodyguard.allow-continuous-protection: true
  general.first-victim: none
---
# Alice (狩) が Night 0 と Night 1 で連続して Carol を護衛 → 連続ガード可、
# Night 1 で Bob (wolf) の Carol 襲撃をブロック → peace、 Carol 生存。
# Day 3 で Bob 処刑 → villager_won

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=狩人
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人
!Alice 0夜 護衛 Carol
!Alice 1夜 護衛 Carol
!Bob 1夜 襲撃 Carol

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# peace
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Eve→Dave
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# Dave 4 / Alice 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 (state.day=3) ==
# Alice 護衛 Carol、 Bob 襲撃 Carol → ガード成功 → peace
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Bob
Carol→Bob
Eve→Bob
Bob→Alice

# == engine: Day 3 (state.day=3) ==
# Bob 3 / Alice 1 → execution=Bob → villager_won
# == end ==

# @expect-result: villager_won
# @expect-finished: true
# @expect-status Carol: alive
# @expect-guard actor:Alice night:1 target:Carol
